      "message": "fix(app): refuse a tangent lead radius at or under the kerf offset at the command door\n\nThe wire gate reads the arc lead radius against the resolved condition's\nkerf offset (wire radius + spark gap) when an operation is made, edited\nor given a new tool. The generator keeps its own check for a loaded file\nor a changed condition. Review finding 1 on #4002.\n\nRefs #3991\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
